==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Hyppoh]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gorilliam]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Maawth]] spawns.

==Strategy==
All enemies are alien, so an [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] set up works great.

The main boss is Gorilliam, to defeat him easily use an Alien [[Freeze|Freezer]] such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Surfer Cat]]. [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Wheel Cat]] can be used to clear the Shibaliens or Hyppohs, but do not even think about using him against anything else, as he will be outranged.

This stage is really easy if the player has decently leveled Cats (lvl. 25 Surfer Cat is enough to one-shot the Shibaliens), because it takes some time before the boss starts to kill your meatshields (and this time can get longer due to his warp ability).

[[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Cats with Warp Immunity]] are not necessary unless you don't have any [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]], you have really low-level Cats or if you don't have strong attackers against aliens.

